    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37828" root="لغث" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَغِيثٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَلِيثٌ</span>, (from which it is formed by
transposition, TA,) in its two meanings: (K:)
<i>wheat mixed with barley;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَغِيثٌ</span>: (TA:)
[and <i>food mixed with poison, by which vultures
are killed</i>].

